pPurchaseApi\":\"4.1.0\",\"name\":\"Higo-Live \u0026 Enjoy Party\",\"genreDisplayName\":\"Entertainment\",\"isPreorder\":false,\"isIOSBinaryMacOSCompatible\":false,\"artistName\":\"PATTI PTE. LTD.\",\"reviewsRestricted\":false,\"requirementsByDeviceFamily\":{\"iphone\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"iPhone\",\"requirementString\":\"Requires iOS 13.0 or later.\"},\"ipod\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"iPod touch\",\"requirementString\":\"Requires iOS 13.0 or later.\"},\"realityDevice\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"Apple Vision\",\"requirementString\":\"Requires visionOS 1.0 or later.\"}},\"platformAttributes\":{\"ios\":{\"minimumMacOSVersion\":\"11.0\",\"description\":{\"standard\":\"Higo, provides a CHILL \u0026 CHAT space for us.  Join Higo's online party!\\nHave a great day with us!\\n\\nWhy Higo？\\nChat With Real People\\n-Higo is an app to chat with real people online, with users from all corners of the world! No matter which country, you can chat together.It’s easy and fun on Higo. \\n\\nEntertaining  Community \\n-Create rooms more convenient     \\n-Higo is filled with diverse, voice content streaming every second!\\n\\nExperience  Avatars\\n-Make an avatar, live chat, \u0026 more with people from all over the world\\n\\nHealthy Community\\n-Many people will share their life moments here, let us thumsup for their wonderful moments. There are also many people who use their own voices to introduce themselves. You can directly listen to her/his voice or browse her/his photos before you know each other.\\n\\nSharing Moment\\n-No matter daily life or mood quotes, sharing your life,Send comments and express likes to your friends.\\n\\nWant more features? Get Higo right now!\"},\"isStandaloneWithCompanionForWatchOS\":false,\"isAppleWatchSupported\":false,\"requiredCapabilitiesForRealityDevice\":\"arm64 \",\"versionHistory\":[{\"versionDisplay\":\"5.30.2\",\"releaseNotes\":\"BUG FIX\",\"releaseDate\":\"2025-02-05\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2025-02-05T08:52:53Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"5.30.0\",\"re